('8f200000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001','Five Signals of a Healthy Project','five-signals-healthy-project','A concise article on the evidence behind reliable project health.','Healthy projects demonstrate clear outcomes, accountable decisions, credible forecasts, controlled change, active risk ownership, and transparent stakeholder communication. Review trends and evidence rather than relying on status colour alone.','article','Project Management',JSON_ARRAY('free resource','project health','governance'),'PCMO Editorial','published',NOW(),JSON_OBJECT('recommended',true),JSON_OBJECT('library',true,'membership',JSON_ARRAY('free','paid')),FALSE,0,'USD','Online article',8,79),
('8f200000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002','What I Learned from a Difficult Stakeholder Meeting','lessons-difficult-stakeholder-meeting','A reflective blog about preparation, listening, evidence, and follow-through.','Difficult meetings improve when the team separates facts from assumptions, clarifies the decision required, listens for underlying interests, records commitments, and follows through reliably. Reflection turns a tense event into professional learning.','blog','Leadership',JSON_ARRAY('free resource','stakeholders','reflection'),'PCMO Community','published',NOW(),JSON_OBJECT('popular',true),JSON_OBJECT('library',true,'membership',JSON_ARRAY('free','paid')),FALSE,0,'USD','Online post',6,78),
('8f200000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003','PCMO Expands Free Professional Resource Library','pcmo-expands-free-resource-library','PCMO adds practical free-member resources across project and contract management.','The expanded Library gives free members access to guides, templates, checklists, articles, insights, reports, and other professional-development materials. New content will continue to be managed through the PCMO administration portal.','news','PCMO Updates',JSON_ARRAY('news','free resources','PCMO'),'PCMO Newsroom','published',NOW(),JSON_OBJECT('featured',true),JSON_OBJECT('library',true,'membership',JSON_ARRAY('free','paid')),FALSE,0,'USD','News update',4,77),
('8f200000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004','Why Forecast Confidence Matters More Than a Single Date','forecast-confidence-insight','An insight into ranges, assumptions, trends, and decision-useful forecasts.','A forecast should explain confidence, assumptions, uncertainty, trend, dependencies, and management action. A precise date without reliable evidence can create false certainty and delay intervention.','insight','Project Controls',JSON_ARRAY('free resource','forecasting','project controls'),'PCMO Insights','published',NOW(),JSON_OBJECT('trending',true),JSON_OBJECT('library',true,'membership',JSON_ARRAY('free','paid')),FALSE,0,'USD','Insight note',10,76),
('8f200000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005','Project Community Platform Update','project-community-platform-update','A project update on improvements to PCMO learning and resource navigation.','The current improvement cycle connects public topic hubs, member learning, certification information, Library content, publications, and community pathways through clearer navigation and richer professional guidance.','project update','PCMO Projects',JSON_ARRAY('project update','platform','community'),'PCMO Delivery Team','published',NOW(),JSON_OBJECT(),JSON_OBJECT('library',true,'membership',JSON_ARRAY('free','paid')),FALSE,0,'USD','Project update',5,75),
('8f200000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006','Contract Resource Programme Update','contract-resource-programme-update','A contract update on new practice content and member publications.','PCMO has expanded contract-management guidance covering notices, negotiation, obligations, change, claims, records, compliance, relationships, and closeout through free resources and subscribed-member publications.','contract update','Contract Management',JSON_ARRAY('contract update','resources','publications'),'PCMO Contracts Team','published',NOW(),JSON_OBJECT(),JSON_OBJECT('library',true,'membership',JSON_ARRAY('free','paid')),FALSE,0,'USD','Contract update',5,74),
('8f200000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007','Project and Contract Capability Outlook','project-contract-capability-outlook','A report on the connected capabilities needed for modern delivery environments.','The outlook highlights integrated governance, project controls, contract administration, commercial awareness, data literacy, ethical judgement, stakeholder leadership, and continuous learning as connected professional capabilities.','report','Professional Development',JSON_ARRAY('free resource','capability','industry report'),'PCMO Research','published',NOW(),JSON_OBJECT('recommended',true),JSON_OBJECT('library',true,'membership',JSON_ARRAY('free','paid')),FALSE,0,'USD','Digital report',24,73),
('8f200000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008','PCMO Professional Practice Digest','pcmo-professional-practice-digest','A publication bringing together practical project and contract management guidance.','This digest introduces selected PCMO frameworks, checklists, career guidance, standards principles, learning pathways, and professional questions for further exploration across the website.','publication','Professional Practice',JSON_ARRAY('free resource','publication','professional practice'),'PCMO Publications','published',NOW(),JSON_OBJECT('featured',true),JSON_OBJECT('library',true,'membership',JSON_ARRAY('free','paid')),FALSE,0,'USD','Digital publication',32,72),
('8f200000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009','Project and Contract Management Starter Book','project-contract-management-starter-book','A free introductory book for learners entering project and contract environments.','The starter book explains delivery context, governance, roles, scope, planning, risk, stakeholders, procurement, contract obligations, records, change, performance, ethics, and professional development at an introductory level.','book','Foundations',JSON_ARRAY('free resource','book','foundation'),'PCMO Publications','published',NOW(),JSON_OBJECT('popular',true),JSON_OBJECT('library',true,'membership',JSON_ARRAY('free','paid')),FALSE,0,'USD','Digital book',48,71),
('8f200000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010','Free Professional Development Planner','free-professional-development-planner-download','A downloadable planning resource for setting and reviewing development goals.','Define a target capability, current evidence, specific gap, learning activity, practical application, support required, milestone, success measure, reflection, and next action.','download','Career Development',JSON_ARRAY('free resource','download','development plan'),'PCMO Career Resources','published',NOW(),JSON_OBJECT(),JSON_OBJECT('library',true,'downloads',true,'membership',JSON_ARRAY('free','paid')),FALSE,0,'USD','Digital download',6,70),
('8f200000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011','Case Study: Recovering Control of Project Change','case-study-project-change-recovery','A case study on restoring governance, evidence, and forecast confidence.','The case examines an environment where informal changes weakened the baseline. Recovery actions included a change census, impact triage, authority review, commercial alignment, baseline reconciliation, decision deadlines, and transparent forecast reporting.','case study','Change Management',JSON_ARRAY('free resource','case study','change control'),'PCMO Case Insights','published',NOW(),JSON_OBJECT('recommended',true),JSON_OBJECT('library',true,'membership',JSON_ARRAY('free','paid')),FALSE,0,'USD','Case study',18,69)
